  "question": "This is a voter information management system. For voter management, the system records basic information of each voter, including unique voter ID, name, residential address, and registration status. Each eligible voter must register their voting district through the system and can only register in one district. For address management, the system records basic information of each address, including unique address ID, detailed address, and type (city or town). For district management, the system records basic information of each district, including unique district ID, name, and type. A voter's district is determined by their residential address, and each person can only have one address. A district may contain multiple towns, while larger cities may contain multiple districts.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0261\nCREATE TABLE `district` (\n  `district_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `type` varchar(20) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`district_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `address` (\n  `address_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `detailed_address` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `type` varchar(20) NOT NULL,\n  `district_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`address_id`),\n  KEY `address_ibfk_1` (`district_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `address_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`district_id`) REFERENCES `district` (`district_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `voter` (\n  `voter_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `address_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `registration_status` varchar(20) NOT NULL,\n  `district_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`voter_id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `voter_address_id_unique` (`address_id`),\n  KEY `voter_ibfk_1` (`address_id`),\n  KEY `voter_ibfk_2` (`district_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `voter_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`address_id`) REFERENCES `address` (`address_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `voter_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`district_id`) REFERENCES `district` (`district_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
